# Local config, secrets, and machine-specific files
.kopiaignore
# .mcp.json is intentionally TRACKED (not ignored): it only holds the local Slint
# embedded-MCP endpoints (127.0.0.1 loopback, no auth, no tokens), wired to the
# `mise run mcp` tasks for agent-driven UI testing. Its own "//" comment warns
# against adding secret-bearing MCP servers there; those belong in a separate,
# genuinely local file. See docs/runbook (Slint testing).
/betterleaks.toml
.env
.env*.local
*.local.*
cosign.key
local.properties
*.auto.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars.json
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform.lock.hcl

